{"page":22,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:142","surah":2,"ayah":142,"ar_uthmani":"۞ سَيَقُولُ ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ مِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَا وَلَّىٰهُمْ عَن قِبْلَتِهِمُ ٱلَّتِى كَانُوا۟ عَلَيْهَا ۚ قُل لِّلَّهِ ٱلْمَشْرِقُ وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ ۚ يَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The foolish people will say, ‘What has turned them away from the prayer direction they used to face?’ Say, ‘East and West belong to God. He guides whoever He will to the right way.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ سَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"Will say","transliteration":"sayaqūlu","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","en_gloss":"the foolish ones","transliteration":"l-sufahāu","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"What","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَّىٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"(has) turned them","transliteration":"wallāhum","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قِبْلَتِهِمُ","en_gloss":"their direction of prayer","transliteration":"qib'latihimu","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"[on it]","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُل","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِّلَّهِ","en_gloss":"For Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمَشْرِقُ","en_gloss":"(is) the east","transliteration":"l-mashriqu","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the west","transliteration":"wal-maghribu","verse_key":"2:142"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَهْدِى",